<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="14px" color="#1f2937" />
      <mj-text line-height="1.6" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      a {
        color: #1e3a5f;
      }
      .h2 {
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #1e3a5f;
        padding-bottom: 8px;
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#f3f4f6">
    <mj-section background-color="#1e3a5f" padding="24px 20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#ffffff" font-size="24px" font-weight="800">
          Bienvenue sur Poligraph
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="20px 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          Tu viens de t'abonner à La Semaine Poligraph. Chaque dimanche, tu reçois le récap
          parlementaire avec les votes, affaires, fact-checks et la presse de la semaine.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-raw><!-- deputy-block-start --></mj-raw>
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 24px 20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text><span class="h2">Ton député</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text>{{ deputyName }} ({{ deputyParty }})</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <a href="{{deputyProfileUrl}}">Voir son profil complet</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-raw><!-- deputy-block-end --></mj-raw>

    <mj-section padding="16px 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" color="#6b7280" align="center">
          <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Se désabonner</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
